  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "阮ê台語夢——地表上強ê pudding"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>王芊諭、莊喬安</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是地表上強ê <i>pudding</i>--啊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我beh唱心內ê話hōo你聽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有<i>pudding</i>逐家就m̄免驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">正港ê超級<i>pudding</i>就是我</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雖bóng外口ê天才tsiah-nī濟　m̄-koh上suí--ê kan-na阮一个</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê實力真正有影　連厝邊頭尾to來探聽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管偌困難　拍拚就有機會</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">只要有<i>pudding</i> lóng OK</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Siáng叫我tsiah強～無辦法</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄驚人笑阮gōng囝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">（<i>Repeat</i>）</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮是地表上強ê <i>pudding</i>--啊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我beh唱心內ê話hōo你聽</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有<i>pudding</i>逐家就m̄免驚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">正港ê超級<i>pudding</i>就是我<br /><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div>（作者是福和國中ê學生，Tsit篇是uì〈癡情玫瑰花〉改編--ê）</div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div>指導老師林秋鳳註：無意中看著八年仔有tsiah-nī優秀ê改編，就kah in參詳講︰「Kám ē-sái試看māi tī《台文通訊BONG報》投稿？Koh-khah重要ê代誌是，lán叫是學生無要意台語ê學習，m̄-koh以tsit篇來看，ē-tàng感受著台語對in是真有幫贊ê工具！</div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj-VstAfgE4FqOsd4cMF3nsbFI8jyjD42aGCv6yqfSN7qKOIsMf0zq2q_bWC4Mevombw1SjIzNZLW5WM4mGHLfKH1z009BqdyaIGIKsJ7Yc0EwRHpCI4QQEOZT-t4Ic0wVzqLZoji4TB2HJP48AEu_9vd9RCcN2_qJavd7mOZtYCZpRYQ6kRTJML3txZvaD/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEj-VstAfgE4FqOsd4cMF3nsbFI8jyjD42aGCv6yqfSN7qKOIsMf0zq2q_bWC4Mevombw1SjIzNZLW5WM4mGHLfKH1z009BqdyaIGIKsJ7Yc0EwRHpCI4QQEOZT-t4Ic0wVzqLZoji4TB2HJP48AEu_9vd9RCcN2_qJavd7mOZtYCZpRYQ6kRTJML3txZvaD/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/s1424/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\